# shell: desktop
# PVS-050: a stationary rubber band waits at the edge, then scrolls the icon
# view and recomputes which poses lie inside it without another move event.
key 1 ctrl
wait 10
press 60 94
move 200 200
move 200 316
note the band does not grow the selection before its edge delay
wait 5
expect-selected 10
expect-selected-name sub
note held still, it scrolls and gathers newly exposed icons without a move
wait 45
expect-selected 10
expect-selected-name f21.txt
release 200 316
quit
